NAMES.short:
Signed major-radius separation between a measurement position and the
magnetic separatrix, mapped along its flux surface to the outboard midplane;
positive outside the separatrix.

NAMES.sign:
Positive when the wave-driven conventional current flows in
the direction of the magnetic field, so that $\mathbf{J}_{\mathrm{wave}}
\cdot \mathbf{B} > 0$.
